{"name":"-71-A-12","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Hume_TheCircularRuins","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"background","value":"BG-Sanatorium","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"St. Mary's Sanatorium, Mainz District, Frankfurt."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Door_Open","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"With a nurse showing the way, a woman holding a bouquet enters the room with a smile."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"gradientShow","value":"2","raw":"GradientShow"}],"speaker":"Hebe","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You look positively radiant even after just giving birth. You have no idea how jealous I am."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Meyer","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Meyer","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"And you are as refreshing a presence as ever, Frau Hebe."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hebe walks up to the side of the bed gracefully and takes Meyer's hand."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hebe","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You've lost weight. Have you been eating properly these last few days?"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Is the catering not to your taste? I remember you like the food from—"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Meyer","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Meyer","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh, stop fretting over me, I'm perfectly fine."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Meyer","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hebe","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I suppose you're worried about your little cousin."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Meyer","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Meyer","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sigh..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I just feel sorry for her. She was such a good kid and did really well in school. She only ended up going down the wrong path because she was deceived when she was freshly graduated..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I wouldn't have come to you for help otherwise."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Meyer","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hebe","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"By Professor Gray, you mean? I remember she was all over the news a few years ago; she seemed like a professional woman of substance."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Who could've known she was actually doing something so heinous in secret..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Has Nele ever talked about her?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Meyer","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Meyer","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We once had a chat where she mentioned how close they were, and that it was this Professor Gray who got her to work in Galatea."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But since the scandal was publicized, she never brought it up again. I wouldn't be surprised if she's come to resent this \"Professor Gray\"."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Meyer","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hebe","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Is that so?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Meyer","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Meyer","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yeah, every time I bring the woman up, she'll grimace, then promptly change the subject."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Meyer","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hebe","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I see..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Meyer","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Meyer","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'd rather not talk about her either. If it hadn't been for her, Nele would've had a bright future."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Meyer","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hebe","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I understand how you feel. I have also been tricked by well-respected people back in the early days of my career."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Meyer","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Meyer","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But you made it through. You starred in so many successful films, and now you're retired and have a happy family—how wonderful is that?"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If only Nele could also..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Meyer","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hebe","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why can't she? Didn't you even manage to secure a meeting with Mr. Vogt for her?"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Anything is possible with just a nod from that man."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Meyer","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Meyer","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I just hope their meeting will go ahead without a hitch..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Meyer","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Meyer","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But enough of that. Any news about the list of candidates that I've asked you to put together?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hebe","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Of course~"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I've picked out a handful based on your requirements."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_connect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hebe turns on her tablet and starts showing several profiles to Meyer."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hebe","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"These are all boys of good stock and education. I've also made enquiries about their characters; they are all kind and well-mannered gentlemen."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Meyer","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Meyer","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh, I knew I could count on you!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Meyer","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hebe","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Just focus on recuperating. I'll see Nele at eight, and I'll get her to look through the profiles."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Meyer","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Meyer","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Thank you so much for the trouble. Once I'm discharged, I'll definitely treat you to—"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hebe","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hush now."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hebe quiets Meyer by holding up a long, slender finger."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hebe","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You know I don't need anything like that. As long as you get to go home in perfect health, I'm more than happy to help you solve your problems."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Meyer","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Meyer","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You really are the most considerate friend I have..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hebe","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Don't be such a stranger."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hebe deftly opens up the pastry she has brought along and cuts out a piece for Meyer."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hebe","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Now tell me more about your little cousin's hobbies and interests."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"202408_HighWay_a","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_EV9_Intermission","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"On the highway, Mainz District, Frankfurt."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Moto_Run","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"After departing from the sanatorium, the black limousine speeds steadily eastward to the Eschborn District."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"202407_Car_a","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"Assistant","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Frau Hebe, Miss Nele has already set off."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Hebe","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hebe","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Have the c